# The curated 30-document benchmark package is intentionally versioned on
# its dedicated non-main branch. Raw parser captures and page-render review
# images remain local because they are reproducible, redundant, and ~2.6 GB.
*
!.gitignore
!START_HERE.md
!SHA256SUMS.txt
!manifest.json
!all_113_sets.csv
!all_4799_pages.csv
!focus_30_coverage.csv
!source_parser_warnings.json
!verification.json
!pdf/
!pdf/*.pdf
!ground_truth/
ground_truth/*
!ground_truth/README.md
!ground_truth/STATUS.md
!ground_truth/status.json
!ground_truth/capture_last_run.json
!ground_truth/records/
!ground_truth/records/**
!ground_truth/verification/
!ground_truth/verification/**
!ground_truth/legend_learn/
!ground_truth/legend_learn/**
!ground_truth/symbol_sweep/
!ground_truth/symbol_sweep/**
!ground_truth/work/
!ground_truth/work/**
!ground_truth/tools/
!ground_truth/tools/**/*.py
